    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene okoirana ase Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma y’ayio akang’ira goika ase egeita kiarochie moocha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarora obonene bwa Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli bogocha korwa moocha; eriogi ri’ogocha kwaye nigo riarenge koeera buna eri’amaache amaange, na ense ekamorekwa nobonene bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obonene obwo narooche ase okorora nigo bwarenge buna boria narooche ekero nachete gosaria omochie o Yerusalemu, na buna okorora koria konya narorire agwo ase orooche rwa Kebari. Erio ngatung’ama inse nkaumama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obonene bw’Omonene bogasoa Hekalu goetera ase egeita kia moocha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroro agwo Omoika okanyimokereria igoro, okangira ase eraaro ya ime, na nkarora obonene bw’Omonene bwaichoire ase Hekalu eria yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omonto agatenena mbarabare asende, na nkaigwa omonto onde ogokwana nainche korwa ime ye Hekalu eria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, aase aiga nao ekerogo kiane ki’obonene kere, naende nao amagoro ane agotacha. Aiga nimenye ase egati y’Abaisraeli kogenderera botambe. Na Abaisraeli gose abarwoti babo tibakogenderera gokora erieta riane richenu ribe eritachenegeti, goetera ase obonyaka bwabo bw’ogosasiima emegwekano, na emebere ekwete y’abarwoti babo, na aase abo aimokererete igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero barabwo babekire emeriibo yabo ya inse ang’e n’ey’ane, na emetobwa yabo ang’e n’ey’ane, batigire orwaki rwabo ase egati yabo na inche, nigo bakorire erieta riane richenu riabeire eritachenegeti, ekiagera bakorire ay’okogechia. Ase ayio nabasiririe inde nendamwamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiga barusie korwa asende obonyaka bwabo bw’ogosasiima emegwekano, na emebere ekwete y’abarwoti babo, erio nario ndamenye ase egati yabo kogenderera botambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, teebia Abaisraeli amang’ana ayio igoro y’enyomba eyio, erinde basookigwe ase engencho y’amabe abo. Tiga barenge oboagacho obwo obuya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye bakoba nobosooku ase engencho y’amabe onsi bakorire, rirorio oborokie omogwekano bw’enyomba eyio buna erobeirie, na aase aye agosoerwa na aase agosokerwa, na okororekana kwaye, amo nemeroberio yaye yonsi, na amachiiko aye. Oyarikere agwo ase amasio abo, erinde babwate emeroberio yaye yonsi na koyekora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oko nakwo ogochika gwe Hekalu: Igoro y’egetunwa, na aase onsi areo, nabe aachenu mono; ee, okwo nakwo ogochika gwe Hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egesasiimero",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ebi nabio ebirengo bi’egesasiimero, ase ekerengo ki’amaboko amo neki’obogare bw’egesanyi: Enterekerero yaye nigo yarenge ey’ekerengo gi’okoboko okomo korwa inse gochia igoro, na obogare gochia ase egesasiimero ekenyene okoboko okomo. Orosingo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "roetanaine omogo bw’enterekerero eria nigo rwarenge orw’ekerengo gi’ekeng’ese gi’okoboko okomo gochia igoro. Eyio nigo yarenge enterekerero yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa enterekerero inse goika egetambokero kie ritang’ani ki’egesasiimero ekenyene nigo kiarenge obotambe bw’ekerengo ki’amaboko abere gochia igoro, na obogare gochia ime okoboko okomo; na korwa ase egetambokero keria egeke gochia ase ekere ekenene, nigo bwarenge obotambe bw’ekerengo ki’amaboko ane, na obogare bwaye okoboko okomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aase bagoutera omorero na gosambera ebing’wanso igoro y’egesasiimero nigo arenge ay’ekerengo ki’amaboko ane gochia igoro, na korwa aroro emegwekano ene ye ching’unchara yaroisirie yarochie igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na igoro ase egesasiimero eriko riria nigo riarenge eri’ekerengo ki’amaboko ikomi na abere, obotambe na obogare nigo biareng’aine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egetumo ki’egesasiimero nigo kiarenge egi’ekerengo ki’amaboko ikomi na ane, obotambe na obogare nigo biareng’aine. Orosingo rwaetanaine omogo oye nigo rwarenge nobogare bw’ekerengo gi’ekerengo gi’ekeng’ese gi’okoboko okomo. Enterekerero y’egesasiimero nigo yarenge ey’ekerengo gi’okoboko okomo ase chinsemo chionsi na ekeriinero kiaye nigo kiarenge ensemo ya moocha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogwatananwa kw’egesasiimero kebe egechenu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende omonto oria aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Eye nero emeroberio echiikire erakorwe ase egesasiimero ase rituko erio kerabe kiaagachirwe, erinde ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa biruerwe aroro, na amanyinga nabe akonyororokerigwa igoro yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko erio oe abakuani Abalawi b’ororeria rwa Zadoki eeri ensae ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe. Abwo nabwo baeirwe ribaga ri’okong’ika ang’e ase ogonkorera. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio oimokie amanyinga make y’ekeng’wanso ekio, oyagindie ase emegwekano eria ene ye ching’unchara ere ase egesasiimero, na ase chikoona inye chi’egesasiimero, na igoro ase orosingo rw’egesasiimero chinsemo chionsi. Ase enchera eyio nochene egesasiimero na kogekorera okobwatanigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende oire eeri eria oyerue ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe, oyesambere aase achiikire, isiko y’Aase Aachenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria kabere orue egoree ensae, etari na kemocho ase omobere oye, ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe; na egesasiimero gechenwe buna giachenetwe nekeng’wanso ki’eeri eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero gwakoorire kogechena igo, orente eeri ensae na emingichi korwa ase riicho, chionsi ibere chibe chitari na kemocho ase emebere yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ochirente ase obosio bw’Omonene, na abakuani bachinyororokerie omonyoo na gochirua chibe ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa ase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera rituko ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere mobe mokorua egoree eyemo ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe; boigo mobe mokorua eeri ensae na emingichi korwa ase riicho, chionsi chibe chitari na kemocho ase emebere yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase enchera eyio, ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere, mobe mogokorera egesasiimero okobwatanigwa na kogechena, mogiatanane kebe egechenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero amatuko ayio atano na abere aerire, rituko ria gatano na gatato na kogenderera abakuani mbabe bakorua igoro ase egesasiimero ekio ebing’wanso biaino bi’ogosambwa, na ebi’omorembe; erio nario inche indabanchere. Nabo Omonene ateebire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
